{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. PROVIDES FINANCIAL GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2019; AND REPORTS ASSET IMPAIRMENT FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. PROVIDED FINANCIAL GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY EXPECTED REVENUE OF $3,295 MILLION - $3,335 MILLION, NET EARNINGS OF $125 MILLION - $280 MILLION AND DILUTED EPS OF $0.20 - $0.45. FOR THE FULL YEAR, THE COMPANY EXPECTED REVENUE OF $10,286 MILLION - $10,326 MILLION, NET EARNINGS OF $602 MILLION - $772 MILLION AND DILUTED EPS OF $1.33 - $1.70.FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY REPORTED ASSET IMPAIRMENT OF $87 MILLION AGAINST $95 MILLION A YEAR AGO.'}